COMPILATION OF: E46M28

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M28

   1 a 0000 E46M28:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] RUNTIME: three literal items in ONE file PUT. The
   4 a 0006      literal counterpart of E46M27, and the object that says what
   5 a 0006      several literal items of one statement actually reach the file.
   6 a 0006      E17D measures one CHARACTER literal (`'HELLO'`, apostrophes
   7 a 0006      included) and one DECIMAL literal (` 42`) as SEPARATE
   8 a 0006      statements; [C295] measures one blank between them. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M28OUT DAT');
  11 c 0023   put file(outf) list('AA','B','CCC');
  12 c 0053   close file(outf);
  13 c 0059   put list('DONE');
  14 c 0070   stop;
  15 a 0073 end E46M28;

CODE SIZE = 0073
DATA AREA = 0014
FREE SYMS = 384C
END  COMPILATION
